            "sha256": "3c173ef642adcc0e4bc30af8528440bc87a3edec1c72ad9d6d64acaa535078ef",
            "text": "- cruft inventory: `mode: cruft_inventory` plus an explicit request to scan the fixed home-level agent-tool categories; no repository target is required.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
