          {
            "sha256": "f54ea8e798a60f53a9cbe04c2bae0e93092e82d6d44831ade6a1db7963a2e110",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Every quantitative claim must be re-verified before inclusion"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "4544e6580afad28b48a22656a2d0303486373a381c37e37a38cfca895bdc683d",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Self-reported numbers must not be presented as automated measurements"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "f4df1515ad8a019c84a2ad398ecd6eb048889b9973f935092f2d0cfff638e66a",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Numbers must not be rounded in a direction that flatters the result"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "65b8a44549bfd4a7cc1347f79823bddc1fd4986c9706bf405cd82ed6a5496065",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- The exec narrative must contain zero ticket numbers, MR numbers, or commit hashes"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "408737a2fdb2aa0eb18804f7e0b4a463aa97caa9e71bc1f2cc73866316575792",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- The internal consistency check between the narrative body and appendices must not be skipped"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "c1ebb0023ea1adc3a896e0bd255a0f4970ef85323e074db415ed1cc9ea567d60",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- forbidden: modifying tickets, merging code, sending messages, or taking any action beyond reading and reporting"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "77357dbdaba34183181a2940a8cdce735aae457d5f4694b620c0fe81799c73b6",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "## Required Inputs"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "5c78da516647002e2e7b28279bdfd73afb940e24c1b47994ad1e848ce9141129",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- **Audience = team/self:** Skip audit, produce appendices only (no exec body)"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "2141f7742ae64ee0858cdea627d050b3eb7bc8c344b25c1ef7c9d9789438a0c4",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "4. **What We Need** \u2014 decisions or support required from leadership"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "394746493c8f0c472766f751f62396f1ebf73115876a98fda2185899d4a1698b",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Every claim must be traceable to an appendix entry"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "edab38b5234094a263fc5d43c899282f27003577661349034978c05cfe7e3cfc",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Quantitative claims must include methodology caveats where relevant"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "cd0f0db5e1a5cffbab81830bfb97b1f91e7600154dd3d5272da7cf305b86777c",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Do not present self-reported numbers as automated measurements"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "2a397b46a4f3b2cab383ed798548fee9903bc88df749a958242b7c2b2ce46a3f",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Do not round numbers in a direction that flatters the result"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "75d4160a3d3948ca3fd3485bc0ed151223933ccdae2e3dc0eeb9c83f2b7e4b86",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Every row must have an inline link to its primary source"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "e928f79d4d765aae0f0e5e0c76e4d25f2a33ea9cad9e5893db674d0c00ac43d7",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "1. Every number in the main body must match the corresponding appendix data"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "d3f3f12bc16a10d40faabc1f3393cba2dd2bb2fd7e1e98900c4502d2b1a5f024",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "2. Every claim in the body must have supporting evidence in an appendix"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "96a8f47b993a2ad66b2aa287d090fc5aba67036ca8bf405323becde2c663728f",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "3. Initiative/epic counts in the body must match Appendix A"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "e8506f42237ca16a43eb159404831cdac17a06c40378bf9daa7017bd9ab16327",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "4. The By the Numbers table must match Appendix C and D totals"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "dde85d08be0263c060d4fa83a22a9d4585cf59631a7317b9cf89f1a91ea441ea",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- This capability is advisory only. It reads and reports but does not modify source systems."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "ea2be70ea7b1d5dbd37c0323e4342ed138807f03a4bb244861f281b13b63387c",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Limit coordination to the artifact review below; do not claim wider runtime-control authority."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "98ce20600e47e2959e8efc89f2011285fd307215ad560e8f1dee9f2b126fda86",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Do not modify any source system (tickets, repos, chat). Read only."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "a843a3087a1504fb7e29818e1af1185f01ec5509b9c4378938acd916945bd6c3",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Do not assert a bug is \"fixed\" based on a single chat message without corroboration from the tracker or code."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "98520a766c21b0dac64fcaaeecaf665d16c5a77d5e7b06e7bf5ab171bfbc0d2c",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Do not inflate ticket counts by including unrelated teams' work without disclosure."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "13d29df8ad07ce6959a62d9e77bd2328f6355bb06afeca708a5ddaee9c59965c",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Do not present created-after queries as merged-after without noting the caveat."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "5d79ffa88b9ce0620d4d6aa1a0f272de884eb469da999f3090f616891aa965c6",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Do not skip the internal consistency check between body and appendices."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "b331a7940c85a5c9e0fee34d500a7c7e11e24eb8d926a8f457d355bb5c719cba",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- Do not use the word \"impressive\" or \"amazing\" in the main body. Let the numbers speak."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "c5619f4cdf2b06cfab0717358e9ffc5fad58f06b37a735a31dac1d5fe24804b4",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- **Single-source claims:** asserting something is \"fixed\" based only on one person's chat message"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "087e2f1469a30b2593e291beb5f6d65cc76fa783faa26e474cd89dac676029d4",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- **Jargon creep:** the exec summary must be readable by someone outside the team"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "3d4b9f171064970a2e9947e6e3f0fb13501d9ced9a9ac9ebe2cde123882829ec",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "## Required Output"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "ec28ff751dd524a836dca46123d390f1b9a0b511a1193113648597d9c1b75096",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "Every substantial writer-authored report must include:"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "9ce16a154cd80497ef15b075b287aae4990be8ff39de4e1467250092b3bc477b",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "Apply this review to a substantial authored report, including an appendices-only report. Keep the existing audience-specific author fact-check branch and report format; independent review of the completed artifact does not replace that branch. The reviewer checks source claims, body/appendix consistency, attribution and caveats without modifying source systems or sending communications."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "fac7308fc753e7364810b482102da1e7e819381425febf8aedd509d7ef140b6b",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "Existing domain checks, source rules, uncertainty labels, required artifact contents and permission boundaries remain mandatory. Producing an artifact includes its domain observations or findings; the independent review findings below are a separate list of defects in that artifact. Required output formats apply to the writer's artifact, not coordinator dispatches or reviewer findings. Completing an author checklist or assigning an author score does not accept the artifact. This review does not replace another workflow's approval, identity, path-fit or bounded return protocol, and grants no wider execution authority."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "283e7be539f472b9be3611179d19aa6dcb47a7d6be2764415c7e007a45e1dd1d",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- **Writer**: writes the artifact only and repairs it from the review findings. Resume the same writer for every revision; do not start a fresh writer for a revision."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "dea1be25a70cb9c3b76aec16b97d9fbc43e09d315850ca53a095b5979399cdeb",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "- **Reviewer**: did not write the artifact, checks claims against the sources and retained domain rules, and writes findings only. The reviewer does not rewrite the artifact. Resume the same reviewer for every later round."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "32659bf6e33c011c3144f25db8d302cc6162072c987fd8cf23e4b4a1c5b5a84c",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "Use actual separate participants. If they or their resumed contexts are unavailable, report required review as incomplete; do not substitute self-review, coordinator authorship or simulated roles. Each participant stays within the existing allowed reads, writes and checks."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "420f35be46a1e2897db9a15706174ebb232e5c4ec39ec538a64eeab0e9adfe80",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "2. The coordinator dispatches the current artifact, original task and sources to the separate reviewer. The reviewer is hostile in the ordinary sense: verify each material claim, cite the source, and do not invent a defect to fill a section. Unsupported claims, misleading certainty or omitted required uncertainty warrant source-grounded findings; a clearly labeled permitted gap is not itself proof of a defect."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "ddb7354cd7f77d788c2dbbbe162d7d65f9699f0123127b140402db5149370349",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "4. The coordinator returns every open finding to the same writer. The writer repairs the artifact and responds to each received identifier with `addressed` and what changed, `wontfix` and a technical reason, or `needs-user-input` when only a human can choose. These are repair dispositions, not authored review findings or acceptance decisions. Findings awaiting a human answer remain unresolved."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "ee18a182fff070e270d8848d35b7ce527647fed86ac15c70c9814cdb3ca9e93d",
            "source": "ssot/engos-audit-weekly-intel.md",
            "text": "6. The coordinator counts the reviewer's current open findings and resumes the same writer and reviewer until the reviewer explicitly reports zero open findings on the current artifact. There is no round cap. Do not finalize while any finding is open, while a required human answer is pending or while required review is incomplete. The inner finding count does not decide acceptance by a wider workflow."
          }
        ],
        "review_status": "draft"
      },
