            "text": "3. **PPTX** \u2014 a widescreen, image-only PowerPoint assembled from the PNGs.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-content-dynamic-html-presentations:L18:bf13c58aea84",
