            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "Use this only after there is an existing PR/MR review thread, inline comment, requested-change discussion, or explicit reviewer note to address. If the user has not received review feedback yet and wants a quality gate before committing or pushing, use `engos-quality-code-review` instead."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "f36101a477462e79b9199d8ca56af6452a1cc623e78e9d0b8e08a6a7077904d7",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "Read open review comments from a PR/MR, present them to the user, apply the requested changes with minimal scope, and prepare a commit with only the reviewer-requested fixes."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "578289f1f18391bf464822acd6518a00ecfc83cf4d47aa5a75139cd21742375a",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "| \"Address only comments 2 and 4\" | `engos-delivery-address-code-review` | selected-comment implementation with narrow scope |"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "733b6cd96c662988a13d726dbd60f89c3ee5928adefef774e2672cd9af45613e",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "Do not use `engos-delivery-address-code-review` to proactively improve code, clean up adjacent issues, or review a diff before a reviewer has commented. It should only mutate files that are tied to selected review feedback."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "4baa80f8e32d10e7f7df9823720e5768d545895892edb660c944963cfcf1d93c",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "- forbidden: modifying code that has no associated review comment, silent bulk refactors, resolving comments without applying the fix"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "77357dbdaba34183181a2940a8cdce735aae457d5f4694b620c0fe81799c73b6",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "## Required Inputs"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "3d4b9f171064970a2e9947e6e3f0fb13501d9ced9a9ac9ebe2cde123882829ec",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "## Required Output"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "42dae89208821e64edd7232105cbe3a8cb9e1e38176bd750bcc858f37f048234",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "Do not edit files until the selected comment set is clear."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "61d7bc98cdc3e63cbd2be5f622dc9a78102fbc75d7c60f92cac7fb4e61a8b495",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "- Stage only the files that were modified to address comments."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "5c7c9bcf16a03d74f317314b929b29ac5eaefd02f3babd88e910e31dc61e1da2",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "- **Only modify code that has an associated review comment.** Do not touch other changed lines in the diff that have no comments."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "30599702f4ce404fa450bf87f112729f5368c50cea10a060fcea29071834de4e",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "- Do not resolve/close review threads programmatically \u2014 let the reviewer verify."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "c44f4bd04d475f33d8d4d33498cc63f9be6625305353e620a1275e54b6559ee4",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-address-code-review.md",
            "text": "- Do not mix unrelated changes into the fix commit."
          },
