            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "- Rendered images are derived and must carry a source identity."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "ddd6b07b2348849d64bafa9e7ebe5e92fe5cade0b15a3e0742f7ab7b21e4b0d8",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "- Never make a document public merely to unblock image insertion."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "0b71127f1803d2265453b841f1e88db8ae67d318b1ef254c52d977fab99c600f",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "- Never transmit a pitch or personal file to an external target without the"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "23f42e842b8d739f2971dd094e8ca22027ace598e49edff8e37fb579e0cfc08f",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "- Do not create Jira tickets, implementation code, or a native agent surface."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "04979d5c9f0e72784ee30e930786902cf808c53a1322e2769ef02f976b0cd2ef",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "- The adapter must not rewrite component names, contract states, owners, or"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "2282cb4864a29c76dace482e7d117d116df8b97972e3221ea93aae3601b5666f",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "- Public Drive sharing is never a required prerequisite for a private Google"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "2c4d789ada86e85afef6cf96dfd4daa1c07943974227b8168e0f35585f17e078",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "Doc. If the only available image insertion path requires a public URL, stop"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "a88db5cd38abbf7b5155442404fb2bfc7019a7f23e457f00141b30ee36277a1e",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "bundle, not only diagrams. This section refines the artifact-only workflow above:"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "f9f42d2f21f794440ba3c78365ebcacce56b029b6e13fd9ae0f13857777a3213",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "use. Do not substitute artifact existence or successful conversion for validation."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "21223df3733cddbc5ef6418539f25f778999f4fc3108c69d1d1d2b54260e25dd",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "before retrying; never silently duplicate a target. G4 verifies all requested"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "1538fe5f3466ef4815b812b85392a6794dd252f4582fcc2a9fa098d3ab5402a6",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "capability-detection and fidelity checks; full-run gating applies only when a"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "34493bdbdf05bbdb5ddac7d8f9a19981055940729fe72b6eff73f0fac8b132d0",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "and section/figure/table mappings where supported. A Framed-only source must not"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "74ed88fd68659613378f0208ac4ab42bbf1f36710f89759f78920d34f46fe204",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "require a fabricated shaped bundle. Rich Shaped views preserve every required"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "c0b4bc18f97d5ab8a4ab3c75d54caef1fe2ca43c834454998df4586c5c1c32d0",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "may link stable-ID supporting detail, but every original field/value must survive."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "693f4e0ef86689ca0ba76f0a95f5fa5275e1d36d5f01b970c6ba7f493bd216d3",
            "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
            "text": "quiet text/image downgrade. Do not infer an offline product requirement from one"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "8328ec39f39be39959609a6ea45d9076393c1cf2807fd833e0f130ca17bc792d",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/surfaces.md",
            "text": "source inventory. Artifact-only placement remains allowed without claiming the"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "a12267449d98ee8a76816792a6345699f77a44d22fad495fa7f8190ca727331c",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/surfaces.md",
            "text": "public-URL restriction. An actual policy denial stops that operation. Do not"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "9479100f5c96fd567c1258eb1bced4e2ebae31aadcb8ffc10016ac550042bb91",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/surfaces.md",
            "text": "instead of creating a duplicate. Current saved native Doc must contain every"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "889ba4f834b5d186305cc99bc99c502d8ab43f6f0c89b7fe9cc511d7bbb83855",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/surfaces.md",
            "text": "or deliberate widths; do not drop rows to fit a screenshot."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "85788bad1996a82f042210dfe7cbb6d31aa23bd8009635c0822655498d6c173d",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/surfaces.md",
            "text": "Keep content review passed while reporting delivery blocked. Do not auto-share,"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "b7efcd2fb7a4bd3fd2977df3dfe10f34974b3a288d4e1dddf9ed0a620fe97c50",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "The default `--profile legacy` preserves the prior CLI and required inventory:"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "87c46c1a924f00e921bba2fdb3bedbe19e402413d1e12874612d8eb0b8a882f6",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "data-flow.mmd. `--documents` may add sidecars but must retain those three prose"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "e7e77783af6f9758ec3daa501b3a3f43fdf5a8f902a7aff73a62ec785c2a5d5f",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "files for legacy/shaped. Select relevant files explicitly; do not export unrelated"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "c40de33fcf59c69cfd53aae0df200f8e953bb85827065f773a5fd60a066a3ade",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "requires only those documents. No contracts, security table, diagrams or images"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "d668a509a1982aa2d79f0bc7d33f5908549ab4f4f909a8f494ab4ef188dad3fb",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "are required. Wording, titles and uncertainty remain the supplied author's;"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "fe5bb360ccafb2131a99f9e5447ba2aba67ce5349f2cb84107e830a5f1336a2c",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "Legacy DOCX retains landscape layout and accepts earlier PNG-only manifests."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "d9660342e47b6b1fbf2e67d89e949081075f63e3e5f1c0195924616b45227af8",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "never overwritten; choose a new revision directory. Identical JSON/HTML repeats"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "ba6f48023106e35ecd375756fdefa077011371c3313b204abffb6ac3c1f04475",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "references become readable `label (destination)` text; they never open local files"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "32c8b2a1cf380c79ecf57ac33a06887757d26a91f7d995321b5482fd23d023a3",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "Missing figure anchors fail; placement is never guessed. Each figure"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "9867903d8f2540477f7f362393bf8cd6e003f63ad481191cd41584943cdece86",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "The presentation file has a separate hash in JSON. Layout changes do not rewrite"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "9ae15f91fc89e158fc4eed089d584e64bc19e8efd8d92bc584295e9f934c8dee",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "Supply the legend explicitly; the exporter never infers meaning from colors."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "9e389d4819858b4bc01e4678bd154bc832340d42ef24be5375f3f5fb368a7ae7",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "only markup syntax is converted to formatting, never prose or uncertainty rewritten."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "4fc16c40af59536e0f98d68dedb886ee0b651249f7c166587f5af172967b80dc",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "and cells. Contract IDs must be unique plain identifiers (letters/digits/underscore/"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "782f3587d1c1f607b9bdd51c5ddebbfd2b36f591441fc722805689152bed17b5",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "Combined fields retain complete values. The helper never shortens cells, derives"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "1cf4df1d270a63659bee34f64003527962ec8c3ff8cd2f67448390a0d72ea16d",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "Every source header must occur exactly once across the 1\u20135 primary groups and"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "e1956d96fcc90ecc3fa3914eaf803ea65b79e7c8c269a39daa89849ec8ae90fe",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "detail list. The first primary group must include id_field for linked detail."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "c5e2c1db5d2da162344995f98d699ccb90912fa051fb5ae7801ad0fe54b1e8a9",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "never downloads one."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "0da1aafc9486457e0fd0021e032bbe86d29b1571ee24f77251942f0c2afbf28b",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "SVG validation runs again when assets are consumed. Only UTF-8 is accepted;"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "438826999b0b253b22d530944aebf67e3415c7813c176c58425ea778b1002dec",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "Mermaid 11.17.2 emits unused animation CSS even for static drawings. Only renderer"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "70486a0fa5262dc39b81f665423bc121f7f4e456924655614a3c3e6a4ac31954",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "Imported assets are validated, never silently normalized. No source bytes or"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "7a51473bb88c35f6a8ff2146da1c840c23d8d63aae1fb3c5902e05b4a2694fcb",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "source hashes are rewritten by this output-only transform."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "dad36d8d429eb5ca7fb1b606c909a29f661eefb4c71acc655ad14c3fcbbbceaf",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "Unsupported content needs a separately reviewed source/layout decision, never"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "e8292f498fa1f8fbac706f4c1178da5e2c67efdfa1c63faa9606477bba906802",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "acceptance; code/asset checks alone do not prove it."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "e6ada71c259fff6a1a557dc1ca58b5c9927dacf9e5854c1067a83e6cf1326ae3",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
            "text": "multi-file snapshot: callers must keep the input bundle quiescent; rendering"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "64cda4d692d7e129b2712aae8985a135fff4a0e38fdc0fcc556916f56aad3e83",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/reconciliation.md",
            "text": "is uncertain: preserve both and ask for the intended base, never last-write-wins."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "0f7e0ede58eb48cedd90fd4ba2a4317daede2f617a7571d5cb6124f61614d049",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/reconciliation.md",
            "text": "the accepted source only through the controller. Re-export from that revision."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "45d1c7fd5079554698dd7cb893cc2ffa4af0c50e01ebf8f866270063793db711",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/reconciliation.md",
            "text": "Use target revision preconditions when updating. If unavailable, do not overwrite"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "29ac94792740b943a501d0e92eecf1ef95f6467adbb648e867a88c8decfda41c",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/reconciliation.md",
            "text": "detection. Do not secretly edit an external document to add that warning. No"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "6b5f6d480544cfe8907a2a26c5bc1cfb03fd847acfb5e7c25752ada523893b04",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "\"\"\"Local shaping exports. Never publishes or certifies review/visual quality."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "0b6784e0ca275798bb1eb9e93cd29e3c8c8b3d5e848839c6ccecf4ec2548a115",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('source path must be relative to a real directory')"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "d2ed1291defbb805d94bf2423878d9a6a48287479d9501aaf59f890a723d4d8b",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('source must be a regular file: '+name)"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "644b1100ab2254a16c7abb9ea7ad87b31cf9bc6f50a37236a87cfb5ed3f4dd00",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "# Escaped pipe is content, never an extra cell. Preserve other backslashes."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "b32d74699dfba7dd6b61e0a8e055ccf2befb936a63ae295dbc9843c2ba5b9a71",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError(\"tables must have explicit closing pipes\")"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "943260a0e6980a0b6f34a3f9d7a7c8b9a04438ff4e9ea6886e6a63d46ec542ed",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError(\"bundle root must be a real directory\")"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "d1b33d05dacea29680cafd18c2e5a198c9a63148f9effb41dce6b2fa3e708ec2",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "required = () if profile == 'framed' else DOCUMENTS"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "7368c7be71527a1a7fb3828819e1c894a649dba4093d9d85ee687298bb3fa78b",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "if not documents or len(set(documents)) != len(documents) or not set(required).issubset(documents):"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "b6691d1d383307649a6dc0ac97d1dc1823a4acdb78d163672d3997e01c4036b5",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError(\"include each required document once\")"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "dffab8642e42b132fc3d76563ae155bb6c7532775c78e9f34bf51004c9e8b6eb",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError(f\"empty required source: {name}\")"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "eb0fc6764f45f04811855ee17bdbefef70dcaeda462f4fee8c244a67c155ae15",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError(f\"required table has no data rows: {name}\")"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "dcc21a9159bb4599efc0961d6f28b9468cf8b58649cb79b02f7b261c56ae4e6f",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "result[\"verification\"] = \"source_export_only; semantic, visual and saved-target review required\""
          },
          {
            "sha256": "0030af0ad4f066af8e9d958c055e9040129537483c374a5732370811ccceceee",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('presentation must map exactly the three diagram IDs')"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "f8829e4a5b7c4a5de163dce6020d820746dd8ca6339bd8f82550fe5c50b53ed2",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('diagram metadata must be nonempty text')"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "29aab4dbfc0dfb0bdcb70d505c15894a34043ac740b61ecff8f7d5c3694de52f",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('tables mapping keys must be contracts.md or security-owners.md')"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "4a5d981b0edf39d6ab91abd24ce036cbad8a005dfe0648d97b508ddae5c81bb4",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "# is explicit layout selection, never a semantic pass."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "a54ae065b1de33ea2e4671f7e2b21d6ed353423719a8f878f0c4e0511586c120",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('--presentation is only supported by the shaped profile')"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "76d28ccb696d4000edf931943d35993fe58ea3adbd3ce7e2e2ec046accdd8cc0",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('each primary group must name its source fields')"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "43a1cbb93ced55ddd5116a0752597d956f2ffb01ad9e96f54ca7cee8afe2901d",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('table map must enumerate every source header exactly once')"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "f713e1bc2508692dfa08cd741f3b5c71e9983692c666a6173fdf9d354745fa08",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('first primary group must include id_field for linked detail')"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "cab2a37f52ee3101c6a9b379b1186b348e643a41bda26ce403b99bea4b894367",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "required = ['ID','Interface','State','Owner'] if contract else primary"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "a70d6792366777cd17bd15c3967a9721e66f5ad2501524ad4b4ae02c4c92ede7",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "if any(h not in roles for h in required):"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "6b6921b603ae4cd5adcfb4e32082a8d0783dfff59786e0b8cf3d678054c2821f",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('contract ID must be a plain stable identifier')"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "be780661ac9570661de32530fd06b9a616e890c8b8ebc469f55ca6021e1c49de",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "\"\"\"Pin each physical output directory; never traverse a replaced symlink."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "438a457a97f18d6d4528ce6bdd269f5f021c6cc99f558615ea4e61cd30f2d639",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "POSIX dir-fd/no-follow primitives are required rather than silently falling"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "e5b1bafbfeeada49b59925108a72897cfdac2e9e58ebc7582752c5bfbaf0057a",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "# Only this explicitly started group, never a broad renderer/process match."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "fb32bb34ef2ea9ff6b51c63ef9e08cf0f4c919c9d32858b3f4396550e34334c8",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "# Decode before declaration checks; never let XML autodetect UTF-16/entities."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "2510672c4aecb71a53800b7f0aabea5563f865df2e21721811f015b86ef3128c",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('SVG must be UTF-8') from error"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "c0f9c809667d7ca63c3fb6b4298f627586f51e8dd8a1c466ebf6c6a122006a58",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "\"\"\"Remove only Mermaid's exact built-in animation CSS when it is unused."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "6f973d1c22be9770d390e945cb5d532149bdbe2b3566891664a0e279e7340b39",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "Called on renderer output, never on source or imported assets. Active/unknown"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "b913d8d9bed771561f98021034783ea435af4091018a13d190c72310e9feb726",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "if len(style): raise ExportError('SVG style must not contain child elements')"
          },
          {
            "sha256": "9a68995cf52c316b0379dccd68a335201098d34522dad8951926e4e9c3997969",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/scripts/artifact_export.py",
            "text": "raise ExportError('Mermaid init supports only static theme/themeVariables/themeCSS; security overrides refused')"
