            "sha256": "a49603692bea6f50bd4f7341bd71727a03029217b944eeb638be576a7810f4f5",
            "text": "4. Apply only contract-neutral formatting automatically.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-meta-instruction-editor:L35:f564388f6807",
            "heading": "Workflow Contract",
