            "source_line": 124,
            "sha256": "21ed843d566710b5fa91b075345eaaa8f4d14a5e1e946685852105908fda6941",
            "text": "2. Help, examples, and details are terminal when `/stop-ult` is absent; return the one matching section and do not execute examples or modules.",
