            "source_line": 16,
            "sha256": "1cfa4817b59fd904e10ab50bc8e8382150f0bb819bf19b62715e21d6324df657",
            "text": "- Validate invariants as well as outputs: retained guarantees, side-effect boundaries, and failure behavior must still hold after decomplecting.",
