          {
            "id": "engos-meta-supercharge:sources/capability-resources/engos-meta-supercharge/references/help.md:L49:f22c32a7ac82",
            "heading": "Per-Module Examples",
            "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-meta-supercharge/references/help.md",
            "source_line": 49,
            "sha256": "f22c32a7ac824db3bf31aed9188c53b4ba9e7018bc4c6cd224dd284c17766e47",
            "text": "- `engos-meta-supercharge /adversarial /debate /deep stress-test this investment thesis using only the provided data: <paste>`",
            "kind": "invariant",
