            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L40:6d0a43473db5",
            "heading": "Internal Runbook Mode",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 48,
            "sha256": "6d0a43473db5e703a70f4a33dd987665b247643b4f634fd5fad7b631b8fdb324",
            "text": "Use Internal Runbook Mode only when the user explicitly asks for the organization's internal incident process, names the internal runbook, or provides internal incident context that clearly requires the internal procedure.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L45:0e41e1f9d91d",
            "heading": "Internal Runbook Mode",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 53,
            "sha256": "0e41e1f9d91df74d9ea8f65dce8a7778a1c49d6270fb73805811ef5df85ad8e5",
            "text": "- do not summarize or expose sensitive internal details unless they are directly needed for the user's current incident task",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L55:6fbac1038dbb",
            "heading": "Workflow Contract",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 63,
            "sha256": "6fbac1038dbb8939077d1ab63a0a34a8efd975e641545d949d1199a470dc8529",
            "text": "4. Produce the next required action with owner, artifact, and timing when available.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L62:73f82f7c79f9",
            "heading": "Tool Boundaries",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 70,
            "sha256": "73f82f7c79f9c1d510edc40287363ab83c79d213744de432dd63e6cd540185ce",
            "text": "- Forbidden: making Incident Commander decisions, escalating without IC confirmation, modifying tickets or artifacts without explicit instruction, exposing internal runbook details in generic mode, or treating private links as public documentation.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L70:60ffec051b9e",
            "heading": "Invocation Hints",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 78,
            "sha256": "60ffec051b9e77ba0b9ee155c8a62fe04142f152dee103c2d29ef1f3c7ec553a",
            "text": "- determine if executive communication is required",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
