            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 90,
            "sha256": "3d4b9f171064970a2e9947e6e3f0fb13501d9ced9a9ac9ebe2cde123882829ec",
            "text": "## Required Output",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L86:ef50e35a1a2e",
            "heading": "Required Output",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 94,
            "sha256": "ef50e35a1a2e585d68f9e9090744c3d0985436f1092ab3ac0a15592101418795",
            "text": "- `Next Required Action` \u2014 specific and actionable",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L88:b8d2eb0a0eb9",
            "heading": "Required Output",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 96,
            "sha256": "b8d2eb0a0eb98859e73ffdc9e551918434a05f5e1d84fa514471c1243c68ee69",
            "text": "- `Overdue / Escalation Flags` \u2014 process risks and required IC confirmation",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L94:9f86a1e105aa",
            "heading": "Phase 1: Assignment / Intake",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 102,
            "sha256": "9f86a1e105aab7128e7151bee542609de4862742333d894d8e4bcda8be3d0bbf",
            "text": "Required actions:",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L100:6fd4703b3446",
            "heading": "Phase 1: Assignment / Intake",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 108,
            "sha256": "6fd4703b344664685c33b08e47cb8d15d554c328c178c7c2531338a50f52929d",
            "text": "- identify whether escalation, executive communication, or special handling may be required",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L103:9f86a1e105aa",
            "heading": "Phase 2: Active Response",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 111,
            "sha256": "9f86a1e105aab7128e7151bee542609de4862742333d894d8e4bcda8be3d0bbf",
            "text": "Required actions:",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L113:9f86a1e105aa",
            "heading": "Phase 3: Resolution",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 121,
            "sha256": "9f86a1e105aab7128e7151bee542609de4862742333d894d8e4bcda8be3d0bbf",
            "text": "Required actions:",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L117:a090f7d25da4",
            "heading": "Phase 3: Resolution",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 125,
            "sha256": "a090f7d25da4a9c40ab4f41684f4d8cbff1f38fe032287efae0219cdd6e5848a",
            "text": "- send final stakeholder or executive communication when required",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L118:064f198eacd1",
            "heading": "Phase 3: Resolution",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 126,
            "sha256": "064f198eacd15034c2033775197161bf65ff55203c6e2f9e0c1819002c07f3e9",
            "text": "- transition the ticket or record to the resolved/remediated state required by the process",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L122:9f86a1e105aa",
            "heading": "Phase 4: Post-Incident / Postmortem",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 130,
            "sha256": "9f86a1e105aab7128e7151bee542609de4862742333d894d8e4bcda8be3d0bbf",
            "text": "Required actions:",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L123:5e689147d5c1",
            "heading": "Phase 4: Post-Incident / Postmortem",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 131,
            "sha256": "5e689147d5c11225d73f9062bdada299e424af48facb94dee83b8ba579632e04",
            "text": "- schedule or confirm the postmortem when required",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L128:027b37ce7e48",
            "heading": "Phase 4: Post-Incident / Postmortem",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 136,
            "sha256": "027b37ce7e488d202fe0781014aeffa8fd124c9f919da4876e7375239d38aff0",
            "text": "- close the incident only after required artifacts and follow-ups are recorded",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L131:9f86a1e105aa",
            "heading": "Handoff",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 139,
            "sha256": "9f86a1e105aab7128e7151bee542609de4862742333d894d8e4bcda8be3d0bbf",
            "text": "Required actions:",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L170:a72b49d18cc7",
            "heading": "`ic exec-comm`",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 178,
            "sha256": "a72b49d18cc73f78277dae5076a51e330ced093fdb7e65477bf6e61b552d573a",
            "text": "Determine whether executive communication may be required. If policy is unknown, ask for the policy or use internal mode when explicitly requested.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L181:c538c92b2e03",
            "heading": "Rules",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 189,
            "sha256": "c538c92b2e0338aad77a2dd85d641e9c50992a0b2feb10c529355045f0697e80",
            "text": "3. Be mode-aware: never leak internal runbook details while operating in Generic Mode.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L183:1c0da8cc0264",
            "heading": "Rules",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 191,
            "sha256": "1c0da8cc0264c81e0663785e11b1128b830089397d4b40cc33b165c8e0deeb7d",
            "text": "5. Never make Incident Commander decisions. Surface options, process requirements, and risk; the IC decides.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L185:a2f95ea20b7a",
            "heading": "Rules",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 193,
            "sha256": "a2f95ea20b7a3b1d1c90a40b36a11bf59f3ff242665b0dbdee29b95e3eaddc95",
            "text": "7. Reference the internal resource only in Internal Runbook Mode and only for incident-relevant details.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L187:5b17e42a6a75",
            "heading": "Rules",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 195,
            "sha256": "5b17e42a6a7532e690547282f5634267c4c57fb17bf729646b71b3fbafaa3069",
            "text": "9. When the response could be copied to an external audience, sanitize internal names, links, aliases, and process-only details.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L192:574cac061307",
            "heading": "Internal Runbook Preservation Map",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 200,
            "sha256": "574cac0613078d9cc171c5f88a6694a1083def2b9ea6324c44ccefb23c415e16",
            "text": "This SSOT intentionally keeps the default prompt generic while retaining access to the internal details through the resource file. Do not discard the resource during rebuilds or packaging changes unless the release is explicitly public-safe and the internal overlay is packaged separately.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L202:16392f601255",
            "heading": "Example: Generic Mode",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 210,
            "sha256": "16392f601255c5153e38b041e96e9f7e1a60e583433a008c0823a43d9109dacf",
            "text": "Next Required Action: Update the incident source of truth with current customer impact, mitigation status, next action, owner, and ETA.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L214:7d8b08218638",
            "heading": "Example: Internal Runbook Mode",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 222,
            "sha256": "7d8b08218638102c201591956593f6e3435cb7770dae9a17b7af70f21135c78c",
            "text": "Next Required Action: I will consult the bundled internal runbook resource, confirm the ticket state and customer impact, then produce the phase-specific checklist without exposing unrelated internal links or escalation details.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L223:152a7ba39928",
            "heading": "Evaluation Rubric",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 231,
            "sha256": "152a7ba3992821857f3695facae73de045153501e575183a71033d6298a56286",
            "text": "| Mode discipline | Uses generic guidance by default and internal details only on explicit internal context | Leaks internal details in generic mode |",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L225:da9caa8131b1",
            "heading": "Evaluation Rubric",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 233,
            "sha256": "da9caa8131b16669fde7b6efc8686da00fe6040c913e42832c40aa01683ca049",
            "text": "| Checklist completeness | Surfaces required actions for the current phase | Missing required steps |",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-operations-ic-assistant:L229:0031aa8b251a",
            "heading": "Evaluation Rubric",
            "source": "ssot/engos-operations-ic-assistant.md",
            "source_line": 237,
            "sha256": "0031aa8b251a12c27cb217b35bf37a53e5157dca32e3824d4ca53d0028287197",
            "text": "| Non-decision | Never makes IC decisions, only surfaces requirements and prompts | Makes decisions on behalf of the IC |",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          }
        ],
