        "handoffs": [],
        "protected_invariants": [
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L6:c96cd74da63d",
            "heading": "Purpose",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 16,
            "sha256": "c96cd74da63d3012488de26f2409775cee81c7ca1841c64f0caedfd1ed3c3dd1",
            "text": "Do not use this capability when the main job is prompt hardening, import classification, architecture design, or durable long-running analysis memory without a behavioral comparison goal.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L18:a350e3da719b",
            "heading": "Primary Objective",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 28,
            "sha256": "a350e3da719bdc3045eab4a0d3c2d2a39151c02f000f132111e436d112bb2af4",
            "text": "Explore improvements by repeatedly mutating candidates, executing protected evaluations, scoring results, retaining improvements, and rejecting unsuccessful trials within the agreed limits. Return the best accepted candidate and auditable results relative to the original baseline. Prepare formal promotion evidence only when requested and supported; keeping a trial does not grant release or merge authority.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L23:f4310ac32ffd",
            "heading": "Resource Delivery Contract",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 33,
            "sha256": "f4310ac32ffd8de4cdfe52a6a7264f044e4bc0799299180789b8252bdb0f0ac3",
            "text": "Use `python3 \"<resource-root>/scripts/load_module.py\" --route experiment --format text` for actual experiments. Routes `templates`, `bootstrap`, and `promotion` load the respective scaffolding or promotion resources. Read `resources/references/resource-delivery.md` on skill surfaces, or `references/resource-delivery.md` relative to the agent resource root. The map binds every required workflow, template, and bootstrap resource for effective review and identity checks.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L25:aea57beb5b1a",
            "heading": "Resource Delivery Contract",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 35,
            "sha256": "aea57beb5b1a6c34c0ea9297330ec41ffd836b6ff4f1c55035e5fbc45e1ed1b0",
            "text": "If the helper is unavailable, actual tools must supply the full shared and selected dependency contents before work; never substitute an assertion of reading, a hash, or a truncated excerpt. Missing or changed content requires recovery and rechecking. Passing resource delivery proves supplied bytes, not compliance or a successful experiment.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L34:7f7a95be10c5",
            "heading": "Capability Evaluation Contract",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 44,
            "sha256": "7f7a95be10c5b81cd569e8257bf6906c6761cad49b4012a9f77bf314f7a05130",
            "text": "bin/capability-eval calibrate --static-only",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L41:812649042697",
            "heading": "Capability Evaluation Contract",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 51,
            "sha256": "812649042697ce72f41ff6117cbcef11a16446cdced28d91958b5ee8bbbb318d",
            "text": "Valid statuses are `structural_ready`, `behavioral_pending`, `promote`, `hold`, `blocked_contract`, `inconclusive`, `rollback`, and `stale_evidence`. Never translate a structural UAC result into `promote`.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L50:8d831bbc8ef6",
            "heading": "Capability Evaluation Contract",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 60,
            "sha256": "8d831bbc8ef67ebbfe60d4e5be33a671a461605dea21bbf9180a38c96231ff6d",
            "text": "Normal CI is `static` and uses zero model tokens. Model-mediated profiles require an explicit operator or workflow gate. A cap breach, missing required runtime, unqualified judge, stale hash, or surviving critical mutant returns `inconclusive`, `hold`, or `stale_evidence`; it never silently narrows the experiment.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L81:7c938e14f976",
            "heading": "Agent Operating Contract",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 91,
            "sha256": "7c938e14f976f3ca92be740bf56dcb870dab112178e340888342404929dc3610",
            "text": "- run real bounded improvement loops; label dry-run plans as unexecuted and never count simulated trials as experiments",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L83:e9e498ae4987",
            "heading": "Agent Operating Contract",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 93,
            "sha256": "e9e498ae4987e2dbc18311cfe9a5e3249dda5371030dfe58aac12199fd176a95",
            "text": "- prepare change, commit, and merge guidance only after a candidate clears the promotion threshold",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L85:3544543b4c3b",
            "heading": "Agent Operating Contract",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 95,
            "sha256": "3544543b4c3b771c875f41bbe48f2e4de69b1ffa312fb72941939a57f35e7582",
            "text": "The agent surface must never imply unconditional runtime authority. It may recommend, prepare, and validate. It must respect human review gates before promotion unless the user explicitly allows automated action inside the host system.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L89:01d40c6b796f",
            "heading": "Tool Boundaries",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 99,
            "sha256": "01d40c6b796f948458e84e26c0e4e94d756077b493d87378bda101b9bfeab700",
            "text": "- forbidden: claiming an unmeasured improvement, silently widening the editable scope, hiding regressions behind aggregate scores, or merging changes without explicit policy support",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L93:8c902773a407",
            "heading": "Output Directory",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 103,
            "sha256": "8c902773a407c5d57ab48d41a81a292a66e766793f244a951801a9e6ff783938",
            "text": "Use the user's requested destination or an appropriate existing project location for requested durable deliverables, with stable filenames such as `goal-contract.md`, `experiment-ledger.md`, and `scorecard.json`. Create a promotion packet or trace-to-eval artifact only when that workflow calls for it. Update the same authorized artifacts; use Git for durable revision history rather than timestamped or numbered copies.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L95:b9ee662317b8",
            "heading": "Output Directory",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 105,
            "sha256": "b9ee662317b822d567d2ef2797d08a7ccf6326c9f0e799ff99c175c333adff67",
            "text": "Executed experiments need one isolated task working area containing the original baseline, current best, active trial, and a single ledger of actual results. Keep disposable trial files in temporary storage, discard rejected active changes, and retain the useful evidence and candidate identities in the ledger or Git. Do not accumulate a directory of permanent prompt versions or load experiment outputs as skill instructions. Preserve unrelated files and active work.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L127:fc5ec02a80d0",
            "heading": "Workflow",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 137,
            "sha256": "fc5ec02a80d0a34f53ba09bc85df53ba08fa51447938c84ab99124d9fe5cdf33",
            "text": "7. For diagnosis, use the cheapest discriminating check. For authorized optimization, generate bounded trial candidates from the best accepted state and replay them in isolation using the protected evaluation. Setup checks must not replace the requested search loop.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L130:5cf268c7ff92",
            "heading": "Workflow",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 140,
            "sha256": "5cf268c7ff921506a93b3a1a7056dcfe4a10dcb5cb77c69237047b2eb701f997",
            "text": "10. Keep accepted trial improvements, discard rejected active changes while retaining results, and continue the declared search. When formal promotion is requested, prepare only for verified winners:",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L138:7508be9ead9c",
            "heading": "Decision States",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 148,
            "sha256": "7508be9ead9c29a6115e024147ba2c4dc22d1da8ffd928a6e77d90be33abf320",
            "text": "Every Auto-Research run must end in one of these states:",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L152:41f58abe6c3f",
            "heading": "Decision States",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 162,
            "sha256": "41f58abe6c3fd930e36ba2ee18bb9d08233428135cc1a9052fb5cd334f7d31b5",
            "text": "Never end with an ambiguous \u201clooks better\u201d conclusion. Choose one state and explain why.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L157:4b8080d3e0ad",
            "heading": "Rules",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 167,
            "sha256": "4b8080d3e0ad3083f3294bc9b65bc70c996682eed4bcfba44b8ff3aa90d7d42b",
            "text": "- Define a bounded editable surface. A trial may mutate one or several coordinated elements within it; record the joint hypothesis. Isolate changes when attribution matters, but do not prohibit interacting changes needed to test a hypothesis.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L170:ca133c000e11",
            "heading": "Rules",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 180,
            "sha256": "ca133c000e119317d1df78337b8aba3631d0f234e2a7a19947bc95c493f68ec0",
            "text": "- Never present novelty as evidence.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L184:77357dbdaba3",
            "heading": "Required Inputs",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 194,
            "sha256": "77357dbdaba34183181a2940a8cdce735aae457d5f4694b620c0fe81799c73b6",
            "text": "## Required Inputs",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-optimization-auto-research:L201:3d4b9f171064",
            "heading": "Required Output",
            "source": "ssot/engos-optimization-auto-research.md",
            "source_line": 211,
            "sha256": "3d4b9f171064970a2e9947e6e3f0fb13501d9ced9a9ac9ebe2cde123882829ec",
            "text": "## Required Output",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
