            "sha256": "ea2c2d1bb54fe4a7c80da2f71443f08db2cab47b4ba610d309b79ca344ab695f",
            "text": "7. Recheck the retained best against the original baseline and required regressions. Report no improvement or inconclusive when justified. Keeping an incumbent is distinct from formal promotion, installation, release, or merge.",
            "kind": "guarded_invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
