            "source": "ssot/engos-reconciliation-converge.md",
            "text": "- Do not hide major conflicts behind bland synthesis language."
          },
          {
            "sha256": "00d8595edbcfe6a6680d0eb0867e752edbaf1e4d8aa2a6fafb34b6aca9770fb8",
            "source": "ssot/engos-reconciliation-converge.md",
            "text": "- Do not skip the rationale for rejected ideas."
