            "source_line": 713,
            "sha256": "8488763d032aca6a1821024387b247de3f38618f92b5f2f9bfb017ea4bdbe5c4",
            "text": "- **Stale threads:** messages older than 7 days that were never \ud83d\udd34 or \ud83d\udfe1",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L746:835d2ed8cd15",
            "heading": "Step 10: Sweep (when `/sweep` is active)",
            "source": "ssot/engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse.md",
            "source_line": 751,
            "sha256": "835d2ed8cd15a918fd2a8ff53bd14468c4c7c38f16316c29fbab681b5e46bae1",
            "text": "- `only <criteria>` \u2014 filter the list by natural language (e.g., `only calendar`, `only datadog`, `only older than 1d`)",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L764:a304774228ea",
