            "source": "ssot/engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse.md",
            "source_line": 822,
            "sha256": "f65303b4718650820c33d6c44a55b5dae025ceb8bc04086ff728ed3dd003d600",
            "text": "- All-delete batch: `Type \"delete\" to confirm, or n to cancel` (extra friction for destructive-only operations)",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L818:2a7b9b48b82d",
            "heading": "Step 10: Sweep (when `/sweep` is active)",
            "source": "ssot/engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse.md",
            "source_line": 823,
            "sha256": "2a7b9b48b82ddad70772f355ba107cbeb0725ecbc9133eabc86bf4c58cec3113",
            "text": "- Default to archive, not delete. Only propose delete for vendor marketing, exact duplicates, or obvious spam.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L819:106236a34616",
            "heading": "Step 10: Sweep (when `/sweep` is active)",
            "source": "ssot/engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse.md",
            "source_line": 824,
            "sha256": "106236a346169f8c2d526614f4e5d9d9b2bbad575c9aa62db332aa76c6302e9d",
            "text": "- NEVER propose archiving/deleting messages from VIPs or direct reports.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L820:9f9d339b0d31",
            "heading": "Step 10: Sweep (when `/sweep` is active)",
            "source": "ssot/engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse.md",
            "source_line": 825,
            "sha256": "9f9d339b0d31cdefd6351bd2fe879d2d7fd28b175713439f0cf8965c1928e1cb",
            "text": "- NEVER propose archiving/deleting messages classified as \ud83d\udd34 or \ud83d\udfe1.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L857:a45e0c3fe652",
            "heading": "What Pulse Does NOT Do",
            "source": "ssot/engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse.md",
            "source_line": 862,
            "sha256": "a45e0c3fe6526f36e069c703707982369f5d3de1667e3eae611682866326a208",
            "text": "- Triage mode (default) is 100% read-only \u2014 it never sends, modifies, or deletes anything.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L858:4fd018d180b8",
            "heading": "What Pulse Does NOT Do",
            "source": "ssot/engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse.md",
            "source_line": 863,
            "sha256": "4fd018d180b89d520a48f7042dea63c6ea025d20fa432ac2268542a9dd4ea5bf",
            "text": "- `/act` mode can send replies/messages, but ONLY with explicit per-item user approval.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L859:94b70b846ae3",
            "heading": "What Pulse Does NOT Do",
            "source": "ssot/engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse.md",
            "source_line": 864,
            "sha256": "94b70b846ae3d5f882cca5a3af5d371f342a1b9a6b63919b786243d92934a9bf",
            "text": "- It never auto-sends, auto-archives, or auto-deletes. Ever.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L868:5d0e6583ac81",
            "heading": "Taking Action After Pulse",
            "source": "ssot/engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse.md",
            "source_line": 873,
            "sha256": "5d0e6583ac81c512129e1b5c0b56f62f22afaac06575cb1414251ee9d79227e5",
            "text": "After reviewing pulse output, the user may want to act. Pulse surfaces the ID and suggests the command but **never auto-executes**:",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L874:09dad9a3a19d",
            "heading": "Taking Action After Pulse",
            "source": "ssot/engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse.md",
            "source_line": 879,
            "sha256": "09dad9a3a19df24a152cdf9c0e838d6d7d39c39dbb506c8f061c128e16209e20",
            "text": "Always present the command with the real ID from the table. Always wait for explicit approval.",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L884:14ad4a061c0f",
            "heading": "Example: Hot items only",
            "source": "ssot/engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse.md",
            "source_line": 889,
            "sha256": "14ad4a061c0f467b4fa6709a11a6cf655bf2d0313c2b5bc61b494742aa9abd7d",
            "text": "### Example: Hot items only",
            "kind": "invariant",
            "mapped_to": []
          },
          {
            "id": "engos-triage-my-inbox-chat-pulse:L888:a35faeb97bb3",
            "heading": "Example: Hot items only",
